    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The World Tree is dying, which threatens Seed's world, a cute little seed chosen by the village chief to take over! Traverse various perilous environments in this 3D platformer to save its village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/2628d6a68db4bd04fcbebecd47e18976.avif?t=1755016886\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village is in danger, and you must save it! Traverse 7 environments, each different from the others, to reach your ultimate goal: the World Tree and save your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/8eb7e114bb4148a0abd27e10fe089d9e.poster.avif?t=1755016886\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/8eb7e114bb4148a0abd27e10fe089d9e.webm?t=1755016886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grueling adventure awaits! Overcome a variety of obstacles adapted to the environment that will put you to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/365d5c776a30551ac374427b2ab80041.poster.avif?t=1755016886\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/365d5c776a30551ac374427b2ab80041.webm?t=1755016886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your difficulty level from Easy, Normal, and for the bravest, Hard mode!<br><br>Accessible to small configurations and limited storage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401530/extras/7a7196c84f02995a292d068a2683daf8.avif?t=1755016886\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
